#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of glycin"
msgstr "Instalação do glycin"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If installing Xorg into <filename class='directory'>/opt</filename>, "
"download the needed Rust crates now and apply a patch to allow accessing "
"<filename class='directory'>$XORG_PREFIX/lib</filename> from the sandbox "
"(note that the patch requires <envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> to be set properly "
"for both the current user and for &root; following <xref linkend='xorg-"
"env'/> before building glycin):"
msgstr ""
"Se instalar o Xorg em <filename class='directory'>/opt</filename>, baixe "
"agora as caixas Rust necessárias e aplique um remendo para permitir acessar "
"<filename class='directory'>$XORG_PREFIX/lib</filename> a partir do "
"isolamento (observe que o remendo exige que <envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> "
"esteja configurada corretamente para ambos, o(a) usuário(a) atual e para "
"&root;, seguindo <xref linkend='xorg-env'/> antes de se construir o glycin):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cargo vendor &amp;&amp;\n"
"patch -Np1 -i ../glycin-&glycin-version;-xorg_prefix-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cargo vendor &amp;&amp;\n"
"patch -Np1 -i ../glycin-&glycin-version;-xorg_prefix-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix a build error when a system <application>libglycin</application> is not "
"yet installed:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija um erro de construção quando um <application>libglycin</application>"
" de sistema não estiver ainda instaldo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/get_option('libglycin-gtk4')/(&amp; or get_option('glycin-thumbnailer'))/\" \\\n"
"    -i meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/get_option('libglycin-gtk4')/(&amp; or get_option('glycin-thumbnailer'))/\" \\\n"
"    -i meson.build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>glycin</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>glycin</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"            -D libglycin-gtk4=false \\\n"
"            -D tests=false ..       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"            -D libglycin-gtk4=false \\\n"
"            -D tests=false ..       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:155
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/>, you can build the "
"documentation by issuing:"
msgstr ""
"Se tiver instalado o <xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/>, você consegue construir "
"a documentação emitindo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"/install_dir:.*doc/s|,$| / 'glycin-' + meson.project_version()&amp;|\" \\\n"
"    -i ../libglycin/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson configure -D capi_docs=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"/install_dir:.*doc/s|,$| / 'glycin-' + meson.project_version()&amp;|\" \\\n"
"    -i ../libglycin/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson configure -D capi_docs=true &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, ensure <xref linkend='gtk4'/> is installed, then issue:"
" <command>meson configure -D tests=true &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, certifique-se de que <xref linkend='gtk4'/> "
"esteja instalado e, então, emita: <command>meson configure -D tests=true "
"&amp;&amp; ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid "Now as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D glycin_gtk4=false</parameter>: This parameter disables the "
"build of <systemitem class='library'>libglycin-gtk4</systemitem>.  This "
"library will be built separately as <xref linkend='glycin-gtk4'/>, to avoid "
"a circular dependency."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D glycin_gtk4=false</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita a "
"construção de <systemitem class='library'>libglycin-gtk4</systemitem>. Essa "
"biblioteca será construída separadamente como <xref linkend='glycin-gtk4'/>,"
" para evitar uma dependência circular."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D glycin-loaders=...</option>: Use this option to specify the image"
" loaders to be built.  The default is <literal>glycin-heif,glycin-image-"
"rs,glycin-jxl,glycin-svg</literal>, covering support for all commonly used "
"image formats. You may remove the <literal>glycin-heif</literal>, "
"<literal>glycin-jxl</literal>, or <literal>glycin-svg</literal> loader if "
"the corresponding recommended dependency is not installed, but doing so will"
" cause test failures and hamper the functionality of this package.  There is"
" also a loader for the RAW format but it is not enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D glycin-loaders=...</option>: Use essa opção para especificar os "
"carregadores de imagem a serem construídos. O padrão é <literal>glycin-"
"heif,glycin-image-rs,glycin-jxl,glycin-svg</literal>, abrangendo suporte "
"para todos os formatos de imagem comumente usados. Você pode remover o "
"carregador <literal>glycin-heif</literal>, <literal>glycin-jxl</literal> ou "
"<literal>glycin-svg</literal> se a dependência recomendada correspondente "
"não estiver instalada, mas fazer isso causará falhas nos testes e "
"prejudicará a funcionalidade desse pacote. Existe também um carregador para "
"o formato RAW, mas ele não está habilitado por padrão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/glycin.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D vapi=false</option>: This option allows building this package "
"without <xref linkend='vala'/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D vapi=false</option>: Essa opção permite construir esse pacote sem"
" <xref linkend='vala'/> instalado."

